  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On a mountain peak in True Yang mountain range, opposite Vicious Lightning Fiend, he is already waiting. His vicious reputation has spread far and wide.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_true_yang_mountain_range",
        "char_vicious_lightning_fiend"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He will not accept the challenge without a decent wager. Vicious Lightning Fiend offers one thousand five hundred kilograms of hibiscus branches. He is moved; the wager speaks to his deepest desires. He snorts that Vicious Lightning Fiend even found out his urgent need for hibiscus branches to refine Immortal Gu, then agrees: if he loses, he will give six hundred strands of two-nine thunder heavenly qi.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He waves his hand and untold numbers of fire crows fly, shrouding sky and earth in a boundless inferno. After a while he uses three different immortal killer moves in a row and leaves Vicious Lightning Fiend unable to make ground. Regardless of cultivation, immortal essence, or dao marks, he surpasses Vicious Lightning Fiend and is the strongest opponent Vicious Lightning Fiend has challenged since exiting seclusion.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He then attacks ruthlessly. After sending Vicious Lightning Fiend flying, he tells Vicious Lightning Fiend to admit defeat, then uses great fire demon true body and turns into a giant blazing demon, chasing at extreme speed. A lightning deity detonation leaves both heavily injured. A blood colored light then envelops them, and he shouts Song Zi Xing’s name in fear.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He looks middle-aged and vigorous. He wears tight-fitting martial arts attire with a red cape draping behind. When he uses great fire demon true body, he turns into a giant blazing demon.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His face goes pale when Song Zi Xing descends. Song Zi Xing says that after losing to Feng Jiu Ge, Dan Qiao ambushed him with an immortal killer move, that Song Zi Xing kept the scar, and that Dan Qiao then hid inside True Yang mountain range. He lowers his head, offers to apologize and pay a price, and is refused. In terms of acting, Vicious Lightning Fiend is inferior to him. The two join forces and attack Song Zi Xing; they were bait.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ambush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Blood Tu Su collapses, he is dead. Song Zi Xing holds the corpse, then raises it and detonates it to blast the surrounding immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_blood_tu_su"
      ]
    }
  ],
